OL,5,G2300 Taggart
OL,6,     FWith Matt Burke newly at the helm,
OL,7,     Ftensions are rife amongst the
OL,8,     Fteam. Reid isn't happy when she's
OL,9,     Fsidelined onto a missing person's
OL,10,     Fcase, but then a body is found.
OL,11,G0105 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,12,     FThe police question Vera about the
OL,13,     Frobbery but say they're unlikely
OL,14,     Fto be able to help her. Jacki
OL,15,     Fisn't pleased with the newspaper
OL,16,     Farticle about her case.
